<title>LATVIA: All Latvia T-bill yields under 10 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>All Latvia T-bill yields under 10 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>All yields fell again at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills on Wednesday and all maturities were under 10 percent, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats. There was no auction of</p>
<p>one-year paper.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AVG YLD (pct)    AVG LAST WEEK  ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One month    9.22		 9.34	    1.20  2.21  1.20</p>
<p> Three month  9.44		 19.82	   1.30  3.83  1.30</p>
<p> Six month    9.60		 10.26	   1.50  8.85  1.50</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
